## 2. Fact Labelling, Volatile Links & Upkeep Discipline (`DK5`–`DK8`)

- **Fact Labelling (`DK5`)**: Every statement in this skill carries `VERIFIED` (`file:symbol` cited), `CONFIRMED` (user/approved doc cited), or `OPEN` (must be asked before Gate 1). Zero unverified inferences.
- **Volatile Facts Linked, Never Copied (`DK6`)**: Dynamic counts, tenant lists, feature flags, and version numbers are referenced via links: {{volatile_links}}.
- **Same-Work-Item Upkeep (`DK7`)**: Updated by {{updater}} in the same work item whenever an entity, status transition, role, data scope, or business rule changes. Remaining `OPEN` items touching a work item's scope must be resolved before Gate 1 approval.
- **Zero PII or Secrets (`DK8`)**: Examples, glossary rows, and rules use synthetic placeholders only — never real customer names, emails, phone numbers, credentials, or tokens.

