## 3. Deterministic CLI Verification Gates (`PASS` / `FAIL`)

| Gate | Command | Pass Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| Banned-synonym scan (`DK1`) | `rg -n -i "({{avoid_saying_pattern}})" {{spec_paths}}` | `PASS` when exit code != 0 (0 banned synonyms found); `FAIL` if any match exists |
| Active `OPEN` fact audit (`DK5`) | `rg -n "\bOPEN\b" .agents/skills/domain-knowledge/` | `PASS` when 0 `OPEN` rows affect the current work item's scope; `FAIL` otherwise |
| Secret & PII scan (`DK8`) | `rg -n "(api_key|secret|password|token|@[a-zA-Z0-9.-]+\.[a-zA-Z]{2,})" .agents/skills/domain-knowledge/` | `PASS` when 0 matches exist; `FAIL` on any match |

## 4. Review Severity Rubric (`BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR`)

| Severity | Domain Knowledge & Spec Alignment Criteria |
|---|---|
| `BLOCKER` | Unlabelled or invented domain fact presented as truth (`DK5`); real PII or secret committed (`DK8`); unchallenged contradiction between spec claim and `VERIFIED` code (`DK9`); missing or unconfirmed `Role × Scope × Action` row for an authorization-sensitive change (`DK3`). |
| `MAJOR` | Banned `"Avoid saying"` synonym used in goals, BR, AC, or scenarios (`DK1`); missing status transition or `file:symbol` enforcement location on an affected entity (`DK2`); business rule modified in code or spec without updating the catalog (`DK4`, `DK7`). |
| `MINOR` | Volatile count/configuration value copied inline instead of linked (`DK6`); minor table formatting drift; missing change-log entry when domain facts were otherwise updated (`DK7`). |

